classDiagram
  class ImageRouter {
    +classify_input_type(Image) dict
    -_count_blobs(ndarray, min_size) int
    -_flood_fill(...) int
  }
  class CharacterClassifier {
    +DevanagariCNN model
    +predict(Image) dict
    -_preprocess_dhcd_style(Image) Tensor
  }
  class TrOCREngine {
    +VisionEncoderDecoderModel model
    +TrOCRProcessor processor
    +recognize(Image, force_model) dict
    -_preprocess_image(Image) Image
  }
  class NERExtractor {
    +extract_entities(str) dict
    +summarize_entities(dict) str
  }
  class Preprocessor {
    +full_preprocess(bytes) Image
    +preprocess_for_ocr(bytes) Image
  }
  class GANGenerator {
    +forward(spatial_feats, style) Tensor
  }
  class LDMEngine {
    +generate_handwriting_ldm(text) Image
  }
  ImageRouter --> CharacterClassifier : routes char
  ImageRouter --> TrOCREngine : routes word
  TrOCREngine --> NERExtractor : feeds text
  Preprocessor --> ImageRouter : cleaned image
